    <LocalizedTextData><![CDATA[<LocalizedText><Text id="LOC_TSOD_TYPHON_EMPIRE_MOD_TITLE"><en_US>[The Sword of Dawn (TSOD)] Typhon Empire Civilization</en_US><zh_Hans_CN>《黎明之剑》提丰帝国文明</zh_Hans_CN></Text><Text id="LOC_TSOD_TYPHON_EMPIRE_MOD_TEASER"><en_US>New Civilization and Leader - Typhon Empire led by Rosetta Augustus, from the web novel The Sword of Dawn.</en_US><zh_Hans_CN>新文明和领袖——罗塞塔·奥古斯都领导的提丰帝国文明</zh_Hans_CN></Text><Text id="LOC_TSOD_TYPHON_EMPIRE_MOD_DESCRIPTION"><en_US>This MOD adds the civilization Typhon Empire from the online novel "The Sword of Dawn", led by Emperor Rosetta Augustus.[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]Requires the Gathering Storm ruleset, Rise and Fall, and the Ethiopia Pack DLC (the Mage Tower district reuses its Alchemical Society model).</en_US><zh_Hans_CN>此模组添加了来自网络小说《黎明之剑》的文明“提丰帝国”，领袖为皇帝罗塞塔·奥古斯都。[NEWLINE][NEWLINE]需要《风云变幻》规则集、《迭起兴衰》以及《埃塞俄比亚包》（法师塔区域使用其中的炼金学会模型）。</zh_Hans_CN></Text></LocalizedText>]]></LocalizedTextData>
